## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/blocktogeo.html
- Summary (EN): Compiles a block into a geometry form of its program. The geometry can be used as a fast preview filter in a slap comp, or rendered directly with husk.
- Résumé (FR) : Compile un bloc en géométrie de programme, utilisable comme filtre d'aperçu rapide en slap comp ou rendu directement avec husk.

- Inputs meaning: ["The page documents no input ports; the node references the Block End COP through its Block End Node parameter"]

- Key parameters: ["Block End Node: path to the Block End COP that closes the block to convert", "Input States: All Connected (assumes every block input exists) or Network (compiles the network as it is; only Block Begin ports with data plugged in count as connected)", "Output: program, a geometry representation of the compiled program"]

- Caveats: ["Compiled COP networks do not support simulation", "Input state changes the compiled result: in Network mode unconnected block inputs are treated as absent"]

